      "mergeID": "60c3fc11e3d6a51d98912b42",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Version: VRChat 2020.3.3, build 992.\nDescription of the bug: 100% stuck loading screen\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): The loading screen when reach 100% stays forever with the 0.00b/ that happends when I go to another world or go home and the only way out of it is to exit/quit the game to start over and still will happen randomly.\n \nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots): https://imgur.com/gallery/YAvnFNj",
      "mergedPostTitle": "VrChat loading screen 100% stuck bug",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "604a3a9002cae37cf0769dfb",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Here with the same Problem and contributing to give this issue more attantion. It seems to happen if you dont let all the Avatars load in, gonna try to verify that soon. And the only fix is to Restart the game which gets annoying fast.",
      "viewerReactions": null
